<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data Systems cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data Systems cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Electronic Data Systems Corp to market underperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- also Merrill Lynch reduced its rating on the stock to long-term accumulate from buy, and kept the near-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- on Thursday, company reported that first quarter profit dropped 11 percent and that it was taking a close look at its staffing levels.</p>
</text>
